.TH COF-INSPECT 1 "2026-11-13" "cof 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cof-inspect \- Show orchestration metadata
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
cof inspect [OPTIONS] {orchestration}
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints an orchestration document's path, format, size, model, adapter, and
effect names and count, without running or validating it.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B ORCHESTRATION
Path to orchestration file.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B cof inspect my-flow.yml
Shows a document's summary fields.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
The command failed, or the input was invalid.
.TP
.B 2
A usage error -- an unrecognized option or missing argument.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBcof(1)\fR, \fBcof-validate(1)\fR
